  "143": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "SCENE 3 — FILTERING THE INDEX\n\n<Picture 1> defines <Subject 1>. Preserve the same female character identity, clothing, proportions, face, eyes, and simplified hand-drawn anime appearance. \n\nRender the complete scene as simple nostalgic hand-drawn 2D Japanese family anime with thick clean black outlines, flat pastel colours, minimal cel shading, no realistic textures, no photorealism, no 3D graphics, and no mixed visual styles.\n\n0:00-0:03:\nContinue directly from the previous scene’s push toward the database.\n\nThe camera arrives at a full-screen view of one large illustrated table with exactly TWO columns:\n\nWORD\nPAGE ID\n\nThe table contains exactly FIVE rows in this exact order:\n\nApples | Page 1\nApples | Page 2\nPhones | Page 3\nBaking | Page 4\nApples | Page 5\n\nAll words and page IDs must be clearly readable.\n\nA small version of <Subject 1> stands on the RIGHT side of the table, looking across all five rows.\n\nShe raises one eyebrow and points toward the WORD column.\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral British Female Voice] When you search, the engine doesn't scan the whole web.</d>\n\n0:03-0:06:\nA large flat hand-drawn magnifying glass drops vertically from the top-centre of the screen.\n\nThe magnifying glass is pastel yellow with a thick black outline.\n\nAcross the glass, exact bold uppercase text reads:\n\nMATCH\n\nAll five rows move upward toward the magnifying glass.\n\nThe rows for these exact words are rejected and fly quickly off-screen to the LEFT:\n\nPhones | Page 3\nBaking | Page 4\n\nThe rows for these exact words pass through the glass and remain neatly stacked underneath it:\n\nApples | Page 1\nApples | Page 2\nApples | Page 5\n\nExactly THREE rows remain.\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral British Female Voice] It simply matches your word against its massive index.</d>\n\n0:06-0:10:\nHard punch-in to the three remaining Apple rows.\n\nThe exact search text appears on the LEFT side of the screen:\n\nQUERY: \"Apples\"\n\nThe text briefly grows to exactly 130 percent of its original size with a sharp POP sound, then returns to normal size.\n\nAt the same time, each of the three remaining Apple cells receives a small green check mark directly beside the word Apples.\n\n<Subject 1> points directly at the MATCH line and says:\n<d>[English, Neutral British Female Voice] Now it instantly knows that pages one, two, and five have exactly what you want.</d>\n\nAt the end of the scene, the three filtered rows slide together toward the RIGHT edge of the frame to transition into the next scene.\n\nHard cut."
    },
    "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Input Text Prompt"
    }
